WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:09.200
I spared him for the moment because your son wished to uncover even more conspirators.
Ha! You harbored such grand designs, did you?

00:10.440 --> 00:18.000
May Father see clearly! As Chancellor of the Imperial Academy, Yu Gong mentors legions of scholars each year—who can guarantee none were incited as his accomplices?

00:18.480 --> 00:26.000
When purging treason, one must never leave the roots in the soil! I stayed my hand only to watch him in secret and unearth the entire cabal.

00:26.360 --> 00:34.000
Alas, last night's blunder by the Imperial City Guard startled the snake in the grass, reducing all your son's painstaking schemes to naught!

00:34.480 --> 00:41.000
The Imperial City Guard has always been commanded by your elder brother. Are you implying that your elder brother ruined your grand design?

00:41.480 --> 00:48.000
By no means! This matter could not possibly involve elder brother—it must have been his underlings acting recklessly on their own.

00:54.680 --> 01:03.600
Our urgent priority was to eliminate every witness present at the tavern, sever ties with Yu Gong, and ensure this matter never touched you in the slightest!

01:04.640 --> 01:07.000
Your son would never dare! I take orders from Father Emperor alone.
